 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Progress tasks accept `total=None` for an unknown total, rendering a pulse bar https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/1054
+
 ### Fixed
 
 - Fall back to `sys.__stderr__` on POSIX systems when trying to get the terminal size (fix issues when Rich is piped to another process)
